# Verification command for the Stop gate (~/.claude/hooks/stop_gate.py).
# The first non-comment line below is the command; it runs from the repo root
# and a non-zero exit blocks stopping.
#
# shell: bash
# timeout: 120
#
# Why only these two: they are the project's real gates and both must exit 0.
# The four agent baselines are deliberately NOT here - three of them exit 1 by
# design (a passing adversarial baseline means the golden set lost its teeth),
# so they need expected-exit-code assertions and live in CI instead
# (.github/workflows/verify.yml).
python scripts/build_top40.py --check && python demo/evaluate.py
